Consider this Java 17 switch expression:

    String kind = switch (day) {
        case MONDAY, TUESDAY, WEDNESDAY, THURSDAY, FRIDAY -> "Weekday";
        case SATURDAY, SUNDAY -> "Weekend";
    };

Which statement about the arrow-form switch expression above is TRUE?

